{"candidateAnswer":"Dedication and persistence in pursuing what they love","evidence":"[D21:15 | 2:44 pm on 4 October, 2023] Calvin: Agreed, Dave! Progress is what keeps us motivated and pushing for more. Let's never give up and keep striving for success. We know that hard work and determination matter, and it's what sets us apart. Onwards to our goals!","itemId":"urn:uuid:14848b3b-f6fe-57c8-ae21-71c96fb0ca74","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d424484f1d1afb58b6ede19428af6bb9cd1011ce8150e380e06c6671f73dc842","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What do Calvin and Dave use to reach their goals?","referenceAnswer":"Hard work and determination","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d424484f1d1afb58b6ede19428af6bb9cd1011ce8150e380e06c6671f73dc842"}}]}